      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners consistently praise Dr Maureen Murphy and her clinical team for their empathy, gentle handling, and thorough consultations. Clients appreciate that staff offer practical advice without pushing unnecessary treatments. While a few clients encountered abrupt front desk interactions, veterinary care is widely trusted."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "communication",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 11,
      "title": {
        "en": "Detailed advice alongside scheduling hiccups"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Many clients commend the practice for prompt follow-up emails and comprehensive explanations following examinations. However, several pet owners experienced frustrating communication with reception, citing poor scheduling updates and difficulty booking timely appointments during busy periods."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 11,
      "title": {
        "en": "Reliable diagnoses and successful surgeries"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients report effective treatments and positive clinical outcomes for dental extractions, emergency surgeries, and ongoing feline illnesses. Reviewers appreciate thorough diagnostic investigations that provide clarity for sick animals. While two owners experienced tragic outcomes during palliative care, clinical standards remain respected."
      }
    }
  ],
